  "gh:content": {
    "en": "The paperwork is perfect. That’s why it reeks. I read between the lines. The logs Kaede points to reveal where humans were left behind. Fear, borrowed in the name of justice, was tightening the field.",
    "ja": "書類は完璧。だから臭う。私は行間を読む。Kaedeが指すログは、人間が置き去りにされた場所を示す。正義の名を借りた恐れが、現場を締め付けていた。"
  },
  "gh:index": 2
}